162 {\cf20 // Optionally select which packing heuristic the library should use. Different}\par
163 {\cf20 // heuristics will produce better/worse results for different data sets.}\par
164 {\cf20 // If you call init again, this will be reset to the default.}\par
165 \par
166 {\cf17 enum}\par
167 \{\par
